# Optional HTTP proxy, read at runtime. Only needed for sources that require it
# from your network (e.g. LinkedIn guest job API from mainland China).
# Leave empty to connect directly. This file is an EXAMPLE — commit no real secrets.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in if needed:
#   HTTPS_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:7890
HTTPS_PROXY=
HTTP_PROXY=
ALL_PROXY=
